        }
      ],
      "message": "fuzz: Drop unnecessary mutexes\n\nRemove the `Mutex` from the `coins_view` and `coinscache_sim`\npool startup helpers. Fuzz targets are entered sequentially within a\nprocess and parallel fuzzing uses separate processes/forks, which each\nhave their own copy of the global thread pool. Therefore, a mutex to\nprevent two in-process callers from racing to start the pool isn't needed.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "marcofleon",
        "email": "marleo23@proton.me",
        "date": "2026-07-14T18:21:17Z"
      },
